## 3. Hàm Chính: [mine_cliques_ids](file:///e:/A%20clique-based%20approach%20for%20co-location%20pattern%20mining/cliquecoloc/ids.py#106-165) (Line 106-164)

### Code (Vòng lặp Head-Node)
```python
123:     for s in dataset.instances:
            # ...
127:         head = itree.add_head_node(s)
128:         queue.append(head)
```

### Data Trace: Xét `s = C.1 (5, 4)`
1.  **Line 127**: Tạo [head_node(C.1)](file:///e:/A%20clique-based%20approach%20for%20co-location%20pattern%20mining/cliquecoloc/ids.py#23-34) là con trực tiếp của `root`.
2.  **Line 128**: Thêm [head_node(C.1)](file:///e:/A%20clique-based%20approach%20for%20co-location%20pattern%20mining/cliquecoloc/ids.py#23-34) vào hàng đợi `queue`.
3.  **Hàng đợi**: `[C.1]`.

